WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.076 --> 00:00:17.796
The farmer frowned at Jeremy.

2
00:00:17.797 --> 00:00:20.920
"Let me go!" Jeremy said.

3
00:00:20.921 --> 00:00:24.935
"I'll get rid of you!" the farmer said.

4
00:00:24.936 --> 00:00:29.164
He lifted Jeremy into the air.

5
00:00:29.165 --> 00:00:33.504
"Oh no!" Jeremy gulped.

6
00:00:33.505 --> 00:00:36.547
The farmer was going to throw him!

7
00:00:36.548 --> 00:00:40.917
Suddenly the farmer's line jerked.

8
00:00:40.918 --> 00:00:43.753
"A fish!" the farmer cried.

9
00:00:43.754 --> 00:00:47.416
He dropped Jeremy.

10
00:00:47.417 --> 00:00:52.276
Jeremy hopped away as fast as he could.

11
00:00:52.277 --> 00:00:57.286
He hid under a bush.

12
00:00:57.287 --> 00:01:01.573
"Today is not a good fishing day," Jeremy thought.

13
00:01:01.574 --> 00:01:04.817
"I will just eat flies for supper."

14
00:01:04.818 --> 00:01:16.290
The farmer pulled in his line.

15
00:01:16.291 --> 00:01:18.599
He looked at the hook.

16
00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:22.691
"This is a tiny minnow!" he yelled.

17
00:01:22.692 --> 00:01:27.915
"I want a big fish!"

18
00:01:27.916 --> 00:01:31.567
The farmer tossed the minnow.

19
00:01:31.568 --> 00:01:32.309
Thump!

20
00:01:32.310 --> 00:01:34.891
Something landed under the bush.

21
00:01:34.892 --> 00:01:39.832
"Wow!" Jeremy said. "A minnow!"

22
00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:50.451
He hopped home fast.

23
00:01:50.452 --> 00:01:53.859
Soon Jeremy was very full.

24
00:01:53.860 --> 00:02:08.001
"What a yummy supper!" he said.
